    "name": "Material UI",
    "descriptionZh": "MUI 的 Material UI 产品页：一套实现 Google Material Design 的开源 React 组件库，首页给出安装命令、40+ 基础组件、theming 定制与 CSS utilities 几块介绍，并指向模板商店。",
    "takeawayZh": "装 @mui/material 拿 40+ 个组件。",
    "noteZh": "首屏左边是 Ready to use Material Design components 大标题和 npm install @mui/material @emotion/react @emotion/styled 一行命令，右边是一整块可点可拖的组件演示区，里面有 Temperature range 滑杆、CAKES / PARTY 两个标签页、Brunch this weekend? 的邮件条目和 Yosemite National Park 卡片。往下是 40+ building block components、Build your design system just as you want it to be、Rapidly add and tweak any styles using CSS utilities、The right template for your specific use case 几节，顶部一直挂着 Material UI v9.4.0。",
